     1,
     "Hello,<div><br></div><div>I am getting the following error &quot;some occassion names in EDF not in TDF&quot; when running \n\ndata2oscr on multisession data. I do not get this error when I have captures on every occasion. However, I get the error when I include a session for which I am missing data (no captures) for some occasions. For example, the occasion column would look like this: 11111222233336666... This leads me to believe that the error occurs because I am missing lines for some occasions.</div><div><br></div><div>How can I integrate occasions with no captures in the data so as to not receive the error?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you</div><div><br></div><div>Joel</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
