     1,
     "<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\">Hi Joel,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\">I don’t this having no detections in one of the occasions is the issue here. For example, I create a similar situation here and things run fine:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#385723\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">data(&quot;rbs_ecography&quot;)               </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#c00000\">#load salamander data</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">r1 &lt;- subset(rbs.edf,Session == 1)  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#c00000\">#subset to just session 1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">table(r1$Occasion)                  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#c00000\">#see there are dets in all seven occs<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;\"> 1  2  3  4  5  6  7 <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;\"> 9 12 25 24 26 32 19 <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">r1 &lt;- subset(r1,Occasion %in% c(1:3,5:7)) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#c00000\">#now remove occ 4</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">table(r1$Occasion)                        </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#c00000\">#no detection is occ 4</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;\">1  2  3  5  6  7 <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;\"> 9 12 25 26 32 19<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#c00000\">#now construct the scrFrame (which works):<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">sf &lt;- data2oscr(edf = r1, tdf = list(rbs.tdf1),<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">                sess.col = 1, id.col = 2, occ.col = 3, trap.col = 4,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">                K = 7, ntraps=nrow(rbs.tdf1))$scrFrame<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#c00000\">#and now examining the caphist object we see no detections in occasion 4:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#1f4e79\">apply(sf$caphist[[1]],c(3),sum)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;\">[1]  9 12 25  0 26 32 19<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\">All this is to say that there is a different issue. Are you sure you have provided the right value of </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;;color:#4472c4\">K</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\">?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\">Chris<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
